1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:05,000
3:14 AM. Server Room B.

2
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:13,000
Abhrankan sits alone, tracking a mysterious memory leak.

3
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:19,000
Every minute, the system loses exactly sixty-four bytes.

4
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:27,000
He launches a network scan. Everything looks normal.

5
00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:34,000
Then the scrolling stops.

6
00:00:37,000 --> 00:00:43,000
A single packet appears. Source address: zero point zero point zero point zero.

7
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:52,000
The packet begins rearranging itself into words.

8
00:00:54,500 --> 00:00:57,000
Ah!

9
00:00:57,500 --> 00:01:00,000
TO BE CONTINUED...
